1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,261
Turn your seller list into better conversations.

2
00:00:03,261 --> 00:00:04,444
Meet Repeat AI.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,288
Start by importing your leads.

4
00:00:07,288 --> 00:00:11,065
Paste a Google Sheet link, or choose an Excel file.

5
00:00:11,065 --> 00:00:17,484
Repeat AI brings your sellers into one workspace, organised by building, with their contact details and status.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,637
Now open Sellers.

7
00:00:22,637 --> 00:00:28,703
See who is a prospect, who is at market appraisal, and who is available for sale.

8
00:00:28,703 --> 00:00:32,494
Filter the list to focus on the conversations that matter.

9
00:00:32,494 --> 00:00:35,907
Not interested keeps opted-out sellers out of automated follow-ups.

10
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:40,049
Sold today highlights fresh transaction data in a seller's building.

11
00:00:40,049 --> 00:00:46,253
Open their record to see their details, then Market data for the latest sales, prices, and dates.

12
00:00:46,253 --> 00:00:49,537
That gives your next message a reason to exist.

13
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:56,273
Connect WhatsApp for personalised, automated transaction updates, following your schedule and sending limits.

14
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:00,309
Happy with the default message?

15
00:01:00,309 --> 00:01:01,073
You're ready.

16
00:01:01,073 --> 00:01:02,601
Want your own wording?

17
00:01:02,601 --> 00:01:04,128
Create a custom template.

18
00:01:04,128 --> 00:01:10,239
Name, building, and transaction fields personalise it for each seller, and the preview shows the result.

19
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:16,599
Then decide which buildings get follow-ups on which days.

20
00:01:16,599 --> 00:01:20,042
Choose a day, pick a spreadsheet, and select its buildings.

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:28,674
Give Monday both Act towers, Tuesday Saint Regis, Wednesday the Burj buildings, and Thursday Imperial Avenue.

22
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,220
Review the whole week, then save.

23
00:01:34,220 --> 00:01:37,549
Empty days stay off while weekly scheduling is enabled.

24
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:43,538
You can also watch the buildings you cover for asking-price drops.

25
00:01:43,538 --> 00:01:47,575
Open Burj Khalifa, choose an apartment, and inspect the price chart.

26
00:01:47,575 --> 00:01:53,081
The activity history shows when it was listed, and exactly when the asking price changed.

27
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:05,291
Keep your everyday tools connected: Google Sheets, Excel, Gmail, Outlook, and your calendars.

28
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:11,963
And you don't have to do every step by hand.

29
00:02:11,963 --> 00:02:14,042
Ask Repeat is your smart assistant.

30
00:02:14,042 --> 00:02:15,773
Type, or talk with voice.

31
00:02:15,773 --> 00:02:20,622
Ask for a market summary, find sellers, or prepare a template or schedule change.

32
00:02:20,622 --> 00:02:23,046
Here, it drafts a new message template.

33
00:02:23,046 --> 00:02:24,778
Review the change, then confirm.

34
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,453
At your desk or between viewings.

35
00:02:33,453 --> 00:02:36,191
Keep working across the web, Windows, and mobile.

36
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:40,618
Less admin.

37
00:02:40,618 --> 00:02:41,737
Better conversations.

38
00:02:41,737 --> 00:02:42,855
Repeat AI.
